"gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"attackEffects":{"value":[]}},"flags":{"sf2e":{"linkedWeapon":"3prpESMWWhGH00d3"}},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Ethereal Flight","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>A voska's wings are optimized for flight in areas with subjective gravity, such as the Ethereal Plane. A voska's fly speed in areas of subjective gravity is 60 feet. With exposure and diligent training, some voskas, such as the voska bounty hunter, develop the ability to fly in normal gravity.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"jqLWd4TUp6I2ZKvv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Zap","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>A creature that takes damage from a voska bounty hunter's electrosphere is @UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.sf2e-effects.Item.1fZbuJEbVmE3J4XL] for 1 round. A shocked creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} against attacks that deal electricity damage (even if it's only additional electricity damage, such as a shock weapon) and takes –2 circumstance penalty on Fortitude and Reflex saving throws against electricity effects. The shocked condition ends early if the creature takes any amount of electricity damage from a source other than persistent electricity damage, or if they spend an Interact action to discharge the electricity harmlessly.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"CKeSy9my427XO31J","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Electrosphere","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The voska bounty hunter carries a jury-rigged magic item called an <em>electrosphere</em>. While holding the <em>electrosphere</em> in one hand, they can make electrosphere pulse Strikes and Electrosnares. The <em>electrosphere</em> also causes any nonmagical metal weapon held in their other hand to deal an additional 1d12 electricity damage.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"PcZo1AVxtRl12JJC","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Trick Magic Item","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>As the @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.feats.Item.uR62fVC9FyQAMCO1]{Trick Magic item} skill feat, except the voska bounty hunter can roll a Crafting check in place of Arcana, Nature, Occultism, or Religion. When required, their spell DC is 25 and their spell attack modifier is +17.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"x49q6tlj7ufpt8jR","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Electrosphere Pulse","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["electricity","magical","nonlethal","range-increment-60"]},"damageRolls":{"wfWqcUhL6FobHMWH":{"damage":"2d12","damageType":"electricity","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":18},"attackEffects":{"value":["zap"]}},"_id":"BXSFl7Y2lu64YeQW","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Electrosnare","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The voska bounty hunter is holding their electrosphere and a creature within 60 feet has the shocked condition</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The voska bounty hunter activates their electrosphere to supercharge the electricity cracking through the body of a shocked target within 60 feet, causing its muscles to lock up. The creature takes @Damage[1d12[electricity]] damage and might have its movement impaired based on the results of a Fortitude save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes half damage and is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1} for 1 round.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full damage is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 2} for 1 round.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes double electricity damage is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed} for 1 round.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["arcane","electricity","incapacitation","nonlethal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"7RPVGT1qlH1bRhN4","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}}],"effects":[],"sort":112500,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.8.0"}}